OL,3,AUS rapper postpones O2 arena show after
OL,4,AManchester evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS rapper Don Toliver has postponed his
OL,7,Fconcert at the O2 arena in London on
OL,8,FMonday, a day after his show in
OL,9,FManchester was evacuated following an
OL,10,F"unknown substance" being released into
OL,11,Fthe crowd.
OL,13,F"I'm very sad to sit here and say I
OL,14,Fhave to reschedule The O2 London show
OL,15,Fto December 15th due to unfortunate
OL,16,Fincident last night Manchester," he
OL,17,Fwrote on Instagram.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
